  "description": "Batteries-included LLM tools for redb.Route.Llm. Reference implementations of common agent tools (HttpFetch, ShellExec, Fs, Calc) built directly on .NET BCL APIs — no redb.Route connector dependencies. Each tool is a route + descriptor pair registered via the .AsLlmTool(...) DSL. Optional package — host applications opt in by referencing it.",
